        "comments": "The assembly drChrOppo1.hap1.1 is based on 93x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Haplotypic inversions detected on: Chromosome 8 from 11.24 to 12.21, Chromosome 10 from 4.44 to 6.63, Chromosome 12 from 9.57 to 10.52, Chromosome 15 from 4.84 to 5.80 and 16.01 to 16.64 and Chromosome 19 from 11.54 to 13.27 Mbp.",
